mart='Data/Scripts/016_UI/020_UI_PokeMart.rb'; bp='Data/Scripts/016_UI/021_UI_BattlePointShop.rb'
add('SHOP-DATA',mart,[1,175],'Adapter gets strict item data; buys positive temporary buy override else data price; sell uses nonnegative sell override else data sell; canSell rejects important or price<=0. Resource setter delegates Player; add/remove are one at a time. Quantity windows begin1, cancel0; ordinary sell upper is held quantity; buying flag controls price shown. Item/machine names and display extras are independent from transaction price.',['WP29 §2/§5','SH08/12..17/27'])
add('SHOP-SCENE',mart,[176,576],'Stock list and description/icon presentation, scrolling and refresh retain supplied stock reference. Quantity input wraps +/-1 and changes10 with clamps; initial1 and cancel0. Confirm display uses full quantity*buyprice. Timed feedback waits1.5 seconds except USE; no rendered-pixel claim.',['WP29 §3/§7','WP66C interface'])
add('SHOP-BUY',mart,[577,676],'Normal Buy loop: first affordability guard, important quantity1 confirmation or ordinary maximum min(999,floor(money/price)) with free999, explicit qty0/refusal cancel, second affordability check. Add one by one; complete success updates spent money stat and item count then wallet, deletes important owned from aliased stock, messages, bonus. Failure removes just-added prefix one by one, removal failure raises; no purchase stat/wallet update on that branch.',['WP29 §3.1–3.3/§6','SH01..07/11/18/19'])
add('SHOP-BONUS',mart,[643,665],'Premier bonus after purchase commit: quantity>=10 and registered Premier data. Generous mode any PokeBall floor(qty/10), add until failure, actual bonus count increments stat; zero additions still displays zero result. Legacy only POKEBALL one successful extra. No rollback of purchase on bonus capacity failure.',['WP29 §3.3','SH18/19'])
add('SHOP-SELL',mart,[678,718],'Sell rejection checks important/price<=0 before quantity. Quantity begins1, explicit chosen5 differs default1. Commit old money→setter clamp→actual increase stat→unchecked per-item removals→feedback/refresh. Cancel/refusal before commit writes no sale state.',['WP29 §3.4/§6','SH08..11/27'])
add('SHOP-ENTRY',mart,[720,748],'Entry normalizes each supplied stock element in place and deletes important already owned; menu references same array. canSell flag changes commands. Both ordinary exits clear entire temporary price table; errors/abnormal return have no guaranteed cleanup. No automatic stock reconstruction.',['WP29 §3.1/§7','SH07/26'])
add('BP-DATA',bp,[1,90],'BP adapter positive temporary buy-slot override else BPPrice default1. Setter uses Player BP clamp; no sale. Quantity confirmation full price but number window computes @buying false/nil→floor(unitprice/2)*qty, not floor(product/2).',['WP29 §4/§5','SH20..25/28'])
add('BP-SCENE',bp,[91,424],'BP scene list uses full price; number window initializes1, cancel0, wraps +/-1, +/-10 clamps; quantity subtotal half-price because buying instance variable absent. Visual output remains host dependent.',['WP29 §4','SH25/28'])
add('BP-BUY',bp,[425,508],'Two affordability checks, important1 or normal min(999,floor(BP/price)), free999; complete add updates BP spend and common items count then BP setter→stockfilter→feedback; partial add removes prefix and can raise on removal failure. No sell/Premier branch.',['WP29 §4/§6','SH20..24'])
add('BP-ENTRY',bp,[510,525],'Shared input stock mutated/filtered. Nil greeting emits default then ordinary welcome; supplied greeting emits once. Exit Buy loop farewell then clear overlays then entry farewell, two normal goodbye messages.',['WP29 §4','SH26'])
add('PRICE-WRITER','Data/Scripts/006_Map/008_Interpreter.rb',[440,454],'setPrice strict-resolves item, lazily initializes [-1,-1]; buy writes only>0, explicit sell>=0 stores double, absent sell copies positive buy. Nonpositive buy does not reset existing slots; setSellPrice requires two arguments and delegates buy=-1. Game_Temp mart_prices initialized/cleared {}.',['WP29 §5.2','SH12..16/26'],'Interpreter entire454 lines actually read; path binding from read-io; static only')
add('RESOURCE','Data/Scripts/015_Trainers and player/004_Player.rb',[1,123],'Player creation directly takes Metadata.start_money, while later money/BP/coins/soot setters clamp0..configured max. StartMoney can exceed wallet maximum until a write, including successful free purchase that writes money-0. BP earned setter statistics separate from shop spending.',['WP29 §6–8','R5U03-JXN-003'])
add('ITEM-DATA','Data/Scripts/010_Data/002_PBS data/006_Item.rb',[1,270],'Schema properties exact named FieldUse and BattleUse enums; missing names separately Unnamed, pocket1, price0, half-price sell, BP1, flags[], use0. Important KeyItem/TM/HM; consumable defaults inverse important unless explicit. ShowQuantity is stored true OR !important, independent of Consumable; ordinary explicitfalse still shows quantity, important omitted/false doesnot, important explicittrue does. Full flag compare case-insensitive; IconMail also mail. PBS writer preserves explicit Consumable=false exception. Display plural/portion defaults independent; descriptions/messages and move names consumers do not normalize storage.',['WP27 §2','WP28 §3.6','WP29 §5','R5U03-M05-006'])
add('REGISTRY','Data/Scripts/003_Game processing/005_Event_Handlers.rb',[148,198],'HandlerHashSymbol converts non-Symbol objects responding to id; otherwise keeps input key, without its own strict data lookup. Explicit handler before first matching insertion-ordered conditional; missing returns nil; copy resolves at copy time and reuses chosen handler, no future live alias linkage. Source registration statements differ from expanded runtime identities.',['WP28 §3.1/§4'])
add('BAG-UI','Data/Scripts/016_UI/007_UI_Bag.rb',[1,704],'Ordinary Give is gated by non-egg count, so egg-only lacks command but fainted non-egg qualifies. Register eligibility from utility/handler differs stored direct registration; already registered ordinary item can expose unregister. Important icon additionally requires important and handler qualification. Filter entry resets cursor only with predicate; wrapper restores all original positions on normal selected/cancel return. Use result2 defers selected field item to pause; cancellation after earlier successful use need not preserve cumulative true.',['WP27 §4–5','BG22..31','WP28 §3.2'])
add('PC-UI','Data/Scripts/016_UI/018_UI_ItemStorage.rb',[1,376],'Withdraw and deposit capacity precheck before remove/add pair; important stack skips quantity and moves whole selected stack while displayed singular count. Toss important rejects. Both source and destination manipulation retain operation order, no generic exception rollback. Item storage access may lazily instantiate seeded storage.',['WP27 §4','BG17..21'])
add('READY-UI','Data/Scripts/016_UI/004_UI_ReadyMenu.rb',[1,331],'Ready collection includes registered IDs only when currently held; does not repeat handler registration qualification. Empty items/hidden moves message; cursor state saved. Confirmation then use key helper; field helper determines consume, cancel remains before effect.',['WP27 §5','BG24..26','WP28 §3.3'],'Exact filename normalized from read ledger before publishing; entire331 lines actually read')
add('PARTY-UI','Data/Scripts/016_UI/006_UI_Party.rb',[1,1560],'Normal Item menu filters egg and mail. Item Use routes machine/general helper, Hyper filter uses Scent data flag. MilkDrink/Softboiled request floor(source.totalhp/5), require source HP>request and different eligible target; source loses request even target gains less due cap. BoxLink opening needs current scene permission+item+map gate; FLY cancellation recreates scene without restoring permission. Nested storage preserves aliased party objects.',['WP28 §3.4/§5.1/§5.6','IU59','R5U03-M05-002'],'Own full UI_Party read; UI_Storage internal selection is separately received or explicitly open')
add('PC-MAIL','Data/Scripts/016_UI/019_UI_PC.rb',[1,237],'PC menu lazily gets storage; mailbox give dispatches Party938–956. After guards and transfer feedback, that method first assigns pkmn.mail from mailbox, then evaluates pkmn.mail.item for item assignment. Pokemon586–590 getter clears that mail when no matching held item; nil.item fails before item= commits and before mailbox.delete_at. Separate held-item swap compose cancellation may retain the earlier old-item addition; it is a different prefix. Both finite boundaries already WP64.',['WP64 §3.2–3.3','WP27 §4'],'Exact PC filename normalized against ledger; PC237/Party1560/Pokemon1227 own full reads; corrected method order, no new required')
add('MAIL','Data/Scripts/013_Items/006_Item_Mail.rb',[1,125],'Mail creation and mailbox transfer preserve structured mail identities; compose cancellation does not undo earlier swap additions. Full send/erase checks distinct from bag consume flags; own UI_PC/Party/Pokemon reads close named mail boundary only.',['WP64 §3','WP28 §3.4'],'SOURCE_STATIC; NOT_EXECUTED; corrected006 locator; actual original125-line full-read credit unchanged; mandatory-creb-mail-source-path-clarification.v1.json applies to frozen wrong copies')
add('SAVE','Data/Scripts/002_Save data/004_Game_SaveValues.rb',[1,127],'Bag and player are whole save values validated by outer expected class; global metadata contains PC storage/Phone/step flags. SaveData Marshal envelope/reload conversion does not clamp EV255 or merge/normalize bag replacements. Save conversions remap old bag registration and Phone in listed order; save/load code actually read, disk cycle unexecuted.',['WP27 §6','WP28 §6.6','WP10','WP63'])
add('SHADOW','Data/Scripts/014_Pokemon/003_Pokemon_ShadowPokemon.rb',[1,221],'Shadow creation backs moves and zeros held shadowEV accumulator, not current EV. Hyper gate is entry-specific, Scent flag bypasses item front gate. Purify can commit shadow/hyper/statistics/ribbon/move prefix before invalid current EV255 clamp raises; this is finite optional composition, no default facility handoff asserted.',['WP23 §7','WP28 §6.6','cre001-item-reception.json'])
add('SHADOW-ITEM','Data/Scripts/014_Pokemon/007_ShadowPokemon_Other.rb',[1,460],'Scent handlers combine prior happiness and heart-gauge state; already-zero heart gauge can make scent no-effect. TimeFlute heart>0 returns true but Purify requires gauge0 and may early-return, allowing consume without purification; at gauge0 purification path separate. Existing WP23 records these gates.',['WP23 §7','SH25..27 shadow catalog'],'Actual path supplied by ledger; handler registration and Battle shadow alias not generalized to bypass ordinary gates')
add('NATURE','Data/Scripts/010_Data/001_Hardcoded data/009_Nature.rb',[1,173],'25 complete nature definitions: five neutral empty changes, each remaining +10/-10 percent pair; LONELY attack+/defense-, BRAVE attack+/speed-. Mint uses calc override, leaves displayed natural nature. Constructor missing changes empty, nameUnnamed.',['WP28 IU56','WP19 nature vector'])
add('METADATA','Data/Scripts/010_Data/002_PBS data/016_Metadata.rb',[1,81],'Metadata.get DATA0; missing start_money3000/start_item_storage[], StartMoney schema unsigned with no MAX_MONEY clamp while editor limits. Actual PBS metadata0 StartMoney3000, StartItemStorage POTION; PC creates one registered Potion. Blank-data constructor default[] is distinct from actual PBS sample.',['WP27 BG14','WP29 §6','R5U03-JXN-003'])
add('PAUSE','Data/Scripts/016_UI/001_UI_PauseMenu.rb',[1,321],'Pause Bag result exits scene and sets in_menu=false then pbUseKeyItemInField without confirm-in-field call; Ready path separate. Party hidden move result exits then invokes hidden move; Pokegear/TownMap own fly result. Missing player prevents opening. Each menu effect governs exit and disposal, no generic ensure.',['WP28 §3.3','WP27 §5'])
add('FISH','Data/Scripts/012_Overworld/005_Overworld_Fishing.rb',[1,110],'Fishing count increments before animation; first pokemon StickyHold/SuctionCups speedup; rod bite45/70/95*1.5, hook100; no encounter/early button fails; successful response true. Begin/end common event fallbacks, lock_pattern, movement state and timed polling; item handler still returns true on failed hook.',['WP28 §3.3','IU35..39 field boundary'])
add('OVERWORLD','Data/Scripts/012_Overworld/001_Overworld.rb',[1,750],'Step captures repel_active before on_player_step callbacks decrement or reuse, then encounter with captured flag; forced route/interpreter only generic step trigger. ItemBall/Receive/BuyPrize strict item get and direct partial bag.add; receive message before add, itemBall failure found/full messages, prize only success feedback. pbWait uses uptime and updates map; escape point stores opposite-facing tile then can erase.',['WP27 BG15/16','WP28 §3.3/R01','IU37'])
add('PHONE-DATA','Data/Scripts/010_Data/002_PBS data/021_PhoneMessage.rb',[1,100],'PhoneMessage keyed [type,name,version], default identifier string; exists permits nil name and key collapse, strict get/try_get require String name. Repeated message schema properties arrays, missing entries nil; version0/suffix empty. Actual phone PBS default and CamperJeff/PicnickerSusie complete records, omitted sublists use source fallback. No Phone.singleton get created by different GameData class.',['WP63 §4.3–4.5'])
add('FORMS','Data/Scripts/014_Pokemon/001_Pokemon-related/001_FormHandlers.rb',[1,792],'Full registry and all concrete species callbacks read. Hoopa/Furfrou getForm returns0 on nil/expired time, onSetForm updates timestamp after caller-supplied callback. Rotom first matching appliance move replaced/forgotten and Thundershock lastmove fallback; Kyurem exact Glaciate/ScaryFace↔IceBurn/FreezeShock/FusionFlare/FusionBolt with existence/known guards; Necrozma form1 SunsteelStrike/form2 MoongeistBeam, base forgets both then Confusion ifempty; Calyrex specialmove matching and base accessible learnset filtering plus fallback. No claim unavailable Move/Species records received.',['WP28 §5.6–5.6.2','IU44..48/57'])
add('STORAGE-UI','Data/Scripts/016_UI/017_UI_PokemonStorage.rb',[1,2022],'All visual/mechanical selection bodies full read. Organise party Store rejects lastable/mail/cannot_store; valid deposit chooses freeposition, optionally heals same object preserving ready_evo, sceneanimation then core pbMove aliases object to box and compacts party. Ordinary cancel does not undo earlier nested deposit. Held move/swap/place/release have separate guards and prefix commits. Storage Item refusesegg/mail; take bag.add before nilsetter, give setter then unchecked bag.remove then message/refresh; no generic transaction. Summary/art resources delegated and host not executed.',['WP28 §5.6.2','R5U03-M05-002','WP25/65 finite UI boundary'])
add('FIELD-MOVES','Data/Scripts/012_Overworld/004_Overworld_FieldMoves.rb',[1,969],'Full hidden-move definitions, including unused pbHiddenMoveEvent. SweetScent non-None weather returns before encounter; normal path viewport/fade then type/location/encounter checks, own function no Boolean success, HONEY handler separately true. Fly maptransfer and escapeerase, globaldestination reset; hidden-use direct record bypasses no extra item consume. FieldMove badge/debug/terrain/follower/confirmation gates stay separate from item helper gates.',['WP28 §3.3','IU35','WP58/59 consumer'])
add('COMMAND','Data/Scripts/011_Battle/001_Battle/009_Battle_CommandPhase.rb',[1,265],'Full CommandPhase own read. pbClearChoice overwrites UseItem identity without refund; pbCancelChoice returns unused item before unregMega/clear. Item menu refuses !internalBattle; family1/2/3 requires correct handler and generic item-target qualification, family4/5 does not impose that universalfamilyexistencegate; CanUse precedes RegisterItem. Next command reset only canShowCommands; faint/multiturn differ.',['WP28 §3.5–3.5.1','IU26..28/43/55'])
add('ATTACK','Data/Scripts/011_Battle/001_Battle/010_Battle_AttackPhase.rb',[1,202],'Full AttackPhase own read. Items in priority order for UseItem livingusers only; read current data BattleUse then dispatch1/2/3/4/5; returns early positive decision; no generic identity clear outside handlers. Attack phases prioritymessages→Call→Switch→check→Items→check→Mega→Moves. Definition behavior considered without assuming every caller reaches it.',['WP28 §3.5–3.5.1','IU26..31/55'])
add('ENDING','Data/Scripts/011_Battle/001_Battle/002_Battle_StartAndEnd.rb',[1,568],'Full StartAndEnd own read. Battleloop breaks on positive decision then normal pbEndOfBattle. Ending captures olddecision, changes win+wildcaught to4 but choosesold1 branch; capturestorage and money then currentplayerpokerus then sceneend then eachbattler pbCancelChoice before ability switchout; player participating objects restore currentinitialItems. Refunded itemidentity can therefore refundagain if notcleared by newcommand/faint; no idempotency. Aborted exception separate path sceneendonly.',['WP28 §3.5.1','WP42 §6 finite consumer'])
add('DATA-IDENTITY','Data/Scripts/010_Data/001_GameData.rb',[1,283],'All registry mixins full read. Item symbol registry exists?(nil) returnsfalse; false and other unsupported parameter types fail validation, while unknown valid Symbol/String returnsfalse/nil. Stringtosymbol; get strict raisesunknown, try_get unknownnil but invalidtypesvalidate. Instance== nilfalse,Symbolid,Stringtosymbol,sameclassid,Integerid_number. each insertionorder forSymbols. Generic PBS false omission overridden by Item explicitConsumable=false.',['WP27 §2','WP28 §3.6','SHOP-BONUS identity','facility-item-interface.json'])
add('PHONE-UI','Data/Scripts/016_UI/010_UI_Phone.rb',[1,271],'Full Phone UI read. Visiblecontact list made from persistent contacts; Call passes actual contact directly to make_outgoing, avoiding missingpublicPhone.get. Deletehides/trainersguard then stablevisibilitysort/refresh; sort preserves appropriate groups. ACTION moving uses visible indices on complete persistent array; allvisible3 vector received, hidden-index variation is not automatically covered. No-contact early return before scene; allnormalexits dispose.',['WP63 §4.1–4.3/§5.1'])
add('POKEGEAR-UI','Data/Scripts/016_UI/008_UI_Pokegear.rb',[1,206],'Full Pokegear UI read. Phone button has no enabled contact condition (the line is commented), invokes Phone screen which only emptinesschecks. Direction/back/use trigger order explicit. Map sets temporaryfly destination anddisposescurrentmenu; Jukebox opens different screen. Pause has_pokegear is outerdefaultgate, not PhoneScreen directgate.',['WP63 §2/§4.3','Phone source interface'])
add('SPECIES-DEFINITION','Data/Scripts/010_Data/002_PBS data/008_Species.rb',[1,455],'Full Species schema/constructor/family/export definitions read. Species-form lookup trialID thenbasefallback, constructor maintains positive stats/default1, nonnegativeEVyield/default0, happiness supplied unsigned retained including>255/editor255 notstorageclamp. Moves/tutor/evolutions arrays supplied to Pokemon. Only explicitly listed complete records received; not whole species PBS.',['WP28 §5.3/§5.6','IU50/54/56/57/58','shared R6GR fields'])
add('MOVE-DEFINITION','Data/Scripts/010_Data/002_PBS data/005_Move.rb',[1,408],'Full Move schema/constructor methods and commented code read. TotalPP default5, categoryStatus/default2, power0, accuracy100; exact Flags andItem-based hidden_move? onlyregisteredHM. Dynamic NaturalGift/Fling display tables are enclosed in =begin/=end comments, so active display_type/damage just return static data, not battleper-hit functions. Actual Tackle35,ChargeBeam10,SunsteelStrike/MoongeistBeam5 records separately read.',['WP28 §5.2/§5.4/§5.6','PP7','IU57/58'])
add('EVOLUTION-DEFINITION','Data/Scripts/010_Data/001_Hardcoded data/007_Evolution.rb',[1,676],'Full evolutionregistry and all methods read inclunused/eventdefs. Level returns currentlevel>=threshold, so CaterpieL100 meetsLevel7 ifoutergatespassed; stones compare exactItem param andgender/time/happinessgates where declared. Afterevolution heldconsumption onlymatchingtarget+heldidentity; duplicateShedinja requirespartyspaceandPokeball thenclone+ballremove. No assumption no-defaultcaller means absentsemantics.',['WP28 §5.3/§5.4','IU24/54','WP31 finite dependency'])
add('EVOLUTION-UI','Data/Scripts/016_UI/001_Non-interactive UI/004_UI_Evolution.rb',[1,276],'Full evolution scene read. Animation BACK onlywhencancancel; cancel increments evolutions_cancelled andkeepsspecies. E10 maxlevelCandy returns true afterscene regardlesscancel, so consumes. Success incrementscount beforecry/messages thenafter-method before species assignment/stats/dex/learn; failuresretainprefix. Stone E05 calls pbEvolution(false), disallowcancel; duplicateclone clearsheldandheals. Host image/audio/clock rendering unexecuted.',['WP28 §5.3/§5.4','IU24/54'])
